+> [!NOTE] Unreleased footer-clearance correction
+> The fixed TOC rail uses the shared visible-footer offset, including when
+> `sidebar_enabled: false`. Its scrollable content ends above the footer, so
+> the last taxonomy links remain reachable with the wheel and keyboard.
